id: artisan
name: Artisan
kind: crafting
slots: 1~2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Attacks with it 1(T) higher on the Wound Roll for each Slot it takes.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: For each Quality Slot taken up by the Artisan Quality, increase your Wound Rolls
  made with this Weapon by 1(T).
text: >
  Artisan: Crafted by a master craftsman, this Weapon is a superior example of its kind.
  –Weapon Type: All
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1~2
  –Effects: For each Quality Slot taken up by the Artisan Quality, increase your Wound Rolls
  made with this Weapon by 1(T).

---

[passive]
weapon.wound += 1(T) * $slots;
